title: "PANDA: Predicting Angle from Nanoscale Density Analysis"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Python library that determines the contact angle and the interface shape of liquids confined in slit,
  triangular, square and cylindrical pores from one-dimensional density profiles of molecular simulations.
